function renderParticipant(){let complete=participantState.submitted;let checks=[['✓','Project overview'],['✓','Team details'],[participantState.demoLink?'✓':'○','Demo video or link'],[complete?'✓':'○','Final submission']];$('#participant-checklist').innerHTML=checks.map((x,i)=>`<div class="checklist-row"><span class="checkmark ${x[0]==='○'?'unchecked':''}">${x[0]}</span>${x[1]}</div>`).join('');let count=complete?4:participantState.demoLink?3:2;document.querySelector('#view-participant .checklist-panel .panel-heading p').textContent=`${count} of 4 steps complete`;document.querySelector('#view-participant .checklist-panel .progress-bar').firstElementChild.style.width=`${count*25}%`;document.querySelector('#view-participant .checklist-panel .panel-heading span').textContent=`${count*25}%`}
function saveParticipant(){persistDemoStorage('eventpilot-participant',participantState)}
function setSupportTab(mode){participantState.supportMode=mode;$$('[data-support-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.supportTab===mode));$('#support-form-title').textContent=mode==='technical'?'Contact technical support':'Ask a mentor';$('#support-form-copy').textContent=mode==='technical'?'Tell us what is going wrong and the event tech team will help.':'Tell us where you’re stuck and we’ll find the right person.';$('#support-routing').textContent=mode==='technical'?'Your request will go to the event technical support team. Include any error message or device details.':'We’ll match you with a mentor based on your topic and availability.';$('#support-submit').textContent=mode==='technical'?'Request technical help →':'Request mentor help →';$('#support-topic').innerHTML=mode==='technical'?'<option>Livestream or meeting room</option><option>API or sandbox access</option><option>Submission portal issue</option><option>Device or network issue</option>':'<option>Product strategy</option><option>Pitch feedback</option><option>Climate technology</option><option>Team collaboration</option>'}
function renderParticipantFeatures(){if(participantState.projectName)document.querySelector("#project-name").value=participantState.projectName;if(participantState.projectSummary)document.querySelector("#project-summary").value=participantState.projectSummary;if(participantState.demoLink)document.querySelector("#demo-link").value=participantState.demoLink;if(!$('#checkin-action'))return;$('#checkin-status-title').textContent=participantState.checkedIn?'You’re checked in, Jordan.':'You’re expected today, Jordan.';$('#checkin-status-copy').textContent=participantState.checkedIn?'Your attendance is confirmed. You’re ready to join the sessions.':'Check in to let your team and event hosts know you’ve arrived.';$('#checkin-action').textContent=participantState.checkedIn?'✓ Checked in':'Check in now →';$('#checkin-action').classList.toggle('approve',participantState.checkedIn);$('#keynote-play').textContent=participantState.playing?'Ⅱ':'▶';$('#video-play-state').textContent=participantState.playing?'Ⅱ':'▶';$('#video-title').textContent=participantState.playing?'Building for a breathable future':'Keynote stream paused';if(document.querySelector("#keynote-reminder"))document.querySelector("#keynote-reminder").textContent=participantState.reminder?'✓ Reminder set':'♧ Remind me';$('#presentation-reminder').textContent=participantState.reminder?'✓ Presentation reminder set':'Add presentation reminder →';if(participantState.team)document.querySelector("#view-participant .participant-banner b").textContent=participantState.team==="Team Orbit"?"Team Orbit · Climate Tech":participantState.team;const bookmark=document.querySelector("#keynote-bookmark");bookmark.textContent=participantState.bookmarked?"★":"♧";bookmark.classList.toggle("bookmarked",participantState.bookmarked);$('#submission-status').textContent=participantState.submitted?'SUBMITTED':'DRAFT';$('#submission-status').className=participantState.submitted?'submitted-status':'draft-status';$('#submission-confirm').textContent=participantState.submitted?'Demo submission saved locally. Files are not uploaded to a server.':participantState.draftSaved?'Draft saved in this browser.':'';const hasFile=!!participantState.files?.length;$('#submission-check-items').innerHTML=[['✓','Project summary'],['✓','Team information'],[($('#demo-link').value||participantState.demoLink)?'✓':'○','Demo URL'],[hasFile?'✓':'○','Pitch deck / supporting file']].map((x,i)=>`<div class="submission-check-row"><i class="${x[0]==='○'?'missing':''}">${x[0]}</i>${x[1]}</div>`).join('');$('#support-request-list').innerHTML=participantState.requests.length?participantState.requests.map(r=>`<div class="support-request"><span>✓</span><div><b>${esc(r.topic)}</b><small>${esc(r.id)} · ${esc(r.time)} · ${esc(r.message)}</small></div><span class="request-state">Received</span></div>`).join(''):'<div class="empty-state">You have no open support requests.</div>';$$('[data-social]').forEach(b=>{const k=b.dataset.social;b.classList.toggle('connected',!!participantState.social[k]);b.textContent=participantState.social[k]?'✓ Connected':k==='Share'?'Share ↗':'Connect'});$$('.notification-row').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('unread',!participantState.read));$('.participant-nav [data-view="notifications"] .nav-count').textContent=participantState.read?'':'2';$('#mark-notifications-read').textContent=participantState.read?'All caught up':'Mark all as read';$('#rating-label').textContent=participantState.rating?`${participantState.rating} out of 5`:'Choose a rating';$$('[data-rating]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',Number(b.dataset.rating)<=participantState.rating));if(participantState.feedback)$('#feedback-confirm').textContent='Thanks. Your feedback is saved in this browser.';}
function downloadNotes(){const content='Hack the Future 2025 · Keynote notes\nDr. Anika Bose · Building for a breathable future\n\nKey ideas\n1. Make invisible problems visible: local air-quality data helps communities act on what they can see.\n2. Design for the last mile: tools should meet people where they already make decisions.\n3. Build with the people closest to the challenge: community trust is part of the technology.\n\nFollow-up: How might your project turn a measurement into an action?';download('hack-the-future-keynote-notes.txt',content,'text/plain');toast('Keynote notes downloaded.')}
function downloadKeynotePdf(){const lines=['HACK THE FUTURE 2025','KEYNOTE SLIDE SUMMARY','Building for a breathable future','Dr. Anika Bose | Atmos Labs','', '1. Make invisible problems visible.','Local air-quality data helps communities act on what they can see.','', '2. Design for the last mile.','Tools should meet people where they already make decisions.','', '3. Build with the people closest to the challenge.','Community trust is part of the technology.','', 'EventBase demo resource | Sample PDF'];const escPdf=t=>t.replace(/[^\x20-\x7E]/g,'').replace(/([\\()])/g,'\\$1');let stream='BT /F1 18 Tf 54 748 Td ('+escPdf(lines[0])+') Tj /F1 14 Tf 0 -28 Td ('+escPdf(lines[1])+') Tj /F1 11 Tf 0 -36 Td ('+escPdf(lines[2])+') Tj /F1 9 Tf 0 -18 Td ('+escPdf(lines[3])+') Tj';for(const line of lines.slice(4))stream+=' 0 -25 Td ('+escPdf(line)+') Tj';stream+=' ET';const objs=['<< /Type /Catalog /Pages 2 0 R >>','<< /Type /Pages /Kids [3 0 R] /Count 1 >>','<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 4 0 R >> >> /Contents 5 0 R >>','<< /Type /Font /Subtype /Type1 /BaseFont /Helvetica >>',`<< /Length ${stream.length} >>\nstream\n${stream}\nendstream`];let pdf='%PDF-1.4\n',offs=[0];objs.forEach((o,i)=>{offs.push(pdf.length);pdf+=`${i+1} 0 obj\n${o}\nendobj\n`});let xref=pdf.length;pdf+=`xref\n0 ${objs.length+1}\n0000000000 65535 f \n`;for(const off of offs.slice(1))pdf+=String(off).padStart(10,'0')+' 00000 n \n';pdf+=`trailer\n<< /Size ${objs.length+1} /Root 1 0 R >>\nstartxref\n${xref}\n%%EOF`;download('hack-the-future-keynote-summary.pdf',pdf,'application/pdf');toast('Sample keynote PDF downloaded.')}
function downloadTechGuide(){download('hack-the-future-technical-guide.txt','Hack the Future 2025 · Technical guide\n\nSample REST endpoints:\nGET /api/v1/air-quality?city={city}\nPOST /api/v1/observations\nGET /api/v1/stations/{station_id}\n\nSandbox base URL: https://sandbox.hackthefuture.example/api/v1\nExample only; not a live service. Never use production credentials.\nRate limit: 60 requests/minute; use exponential backoff on HTTP 429.','text/plain');toast('Technical guide downloaded.')}
const keynoteSlides={6:['Measure what matters locally','Neighborhood-scale readings make air quality understandable.','17:32'],7:['Air quality is a human story','The data matters when it connects to daily choices.','20:10'],8:['From data to action','Local air-quality data helps communities make decisions they can see and feel.','23:41'],9:['Design for the last mile','Put useful information where people already make decisions.','27:05'],10:['Trust is part of the system','Community participation makes the data more useful and the solution more durable.','30:14']};
const keynoteTranscript=[{time:'22:58',speaker:'Dr. Anika Bose',initials:'AB',text:'If you take one thing away from this morning: an environmental signal is just a starting point. The useful part is helping people decide what to do next.',slide:'Slide 08 · From data to action appeared at 23:41'},{time:'23:41',speaker:'Dr. Anika Bose',initials:'AB',text:'The step many teams skip is connecting observation to action. If a neighborhood sees its air-quality reading, what is the next choice they can make?',slide:'Slide 08 · From data to action'},{time:'24:30',speaker:'Arjun Rao',initials:'AR',text:'That’s where a lot of promising prototypes fall over. They show a chart, then leave people to figure out the next step on their own.',slide:'Slide 08 · From data to action'},{time:'25:12',speaker:'Dr. Anika Bose',initials:'AB',text:'Design for the last mile. Put the information next to the decision, and build with the people who live with the problem.',slide:'Slide 09 · Design for the last mile appeared at 27:05'},{time:'27:05',speaker:'Dr. Anika Bose',initials:'AB',text:'Trust is not a footer or a policy page. It is part of how the system is built: who can contribute, who benefits, and who can correct it.',slide:'Slide 10 · Trust is part of the system appeared at 30:14'}];
async function persistCheckin(){if(apiMode){try{await apiCall('/api/checkin','POST',{})}catch(err){toast('Could not save check-in: '+err.message,true);return}}participantState.checkedIn=true;saveParticipant();renderParticipantFeatures();toast('Check-in recorded.')}
async function persistSubmission(submit){const payload={project_name:$('#project-name').value.trim(),project_summary:$('#project-summary').value.trim(),demo_url:$('#demo-link').value.trim(),repo_url:$('#repo-link').value.trim(),files:Array.from($('#submission-files').files).map(f=>f.name),submit};if(apiMode){try{await apiCall('/api/submission','POST',payload)}catch(err){toast('Could not save submission: '+err.message,true);return}}participantState.submitted=submit;participantState.draftSaved=true;participantState.demoLink=payload.demo_url;participantState.projectName=payload.project_name;participantState.projectSummary=payload.project_summary;participantState.files=payload.files;saveParticipant();renderParticipantFeatures();renderParticipant();toast(submit?'Submission saved to EventBase. No file content was uploaded.':'Draft saved to EventBase.')}
async function persistSupport(){let msg=$('#support-message').value.trim();if(!msg)return;const kind=participantState.supportMode||'mentor',category=$('#support-topic').value;let id='SUP-'+String(Date.now()).slice(-5);if(apiMode){try{id=(await apiCall('/api/support','POST',{kind,category,message:msg})).id}catch(err){toast('Could not save support request: '+err.message,true);return}}participantState.requests.unshift({id,topic:category,message:msg,time:'just now',mode:kind});$('#support-message').value='';saveParticipant();renderParticipantFeatures();$('#support-confirm').textContent=`Request ${id} recorded. ${apiMode?'An organizer can review it in EventBase.':'It is saved in this browser.'}`;toast('Support request saved.')}
async function persistFeedback(){if(!participantState.rating)return toast('Choose a star rating first.',true);let message=$('#feedback-message').value.trim()||'Rating submitted';if(apiMode){try{await apiCall('/api/feedback','POST',{rating:participantState.rating,message})}catch(err){toast('Could not save feedback: '+err.message,true);return}}participantState.feedback=message;saveParticipant();renderParticipantFeatures();toast('Feedback saved.')}
const keynoteDatabaseName='eventbase-keynote-materials';let keynoteObjectUrls=[];
function openKeynoteDatabase(){return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{if(!window.indexedDB)return reject(new Error('Browser storage is unavailable.'));const request=indexedDB.open(keynoteDatabaseName,1);request.onupgradeneeded=()=>{const db=request.result;if(!db.objectStoreNames.contains('materials')){const store=db.createObjectStore('materials',{keyPath:'id'});store.createIndex('eventId','eventId',{unique:false})}};request.onsuccess=()=>resolve(request.result);request.onerror=()=>reject(request.error||new Error('Could not open resource storage.'))})}
function listKeynoteMaterials(eventId=activeEventId){return openKeynoteDatabase().then(db=>new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const request=db.transaction('materials','readonly').objectStore('materials').index('eventId').getAll(eventId||'EV-01');request.onsuccess=()=>resolve(request.result||[]);request.onerror=()=>reject(request.error||new Error('Could not read resources.'))}))}
function saveKeynoteMaterial(item){return openKeynoteDatabase().then(db=>new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const tx=db.transaction('materials','readwrite'),request=tx.objectStore('materials').put(item);request.onsuccess=()=>resolve();request.onerror=()=>reject(request.error||new Error('Could not save this file.'))}))}
function deleteKeynoteMaterial(id){return openKeynoteDatabase().then(db=>new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const tx=db.transaction('materials','readwrite'),request=tx.objectStore('materials').delete(id);request.onsuccess=()=>resolve();request.onerror=()=>reject(request.error||new Error('Could not remove this file.'))}))}
function formatResourceSize(bytes){return bytes<1024*1024?Math.max(1,Math.round(bytes/1024))+' KB':(bytes/(1024*1024)).toFixed(1)+' MB'}
async function uploadKeynoteFiles(kind){const input=kind==='video'?$('#keynote-video-file'):$('#keynote-presentation-file'),files=[...(input?.files||[])];if(!files.length)return toast(kind==='video'?'Choose a video first.':'Choose a presentation first.',true);for(const file of files){if(file.size>50*1024*1024)return toast(file.name+' is over the 50 MB limit.',true);const name=file.name.toLowerCase(),isVideo=/\.(mp4|webm|mov)$/.test(name),isDeck=/\.(ppt|pptx|pdf)$/.test(name);if(kind==='video'&&!isVideo)return toast('Choose an MP4, WebM, or MOV video.',true);if(kind==='presentation'&&!isDeck)return toast('Choose a PPT, PPTX, or PDF file.',true);const item={id:(crypto.randomUUID?crypto.randomUUID():'material-'+Date.now()+'-'+Math.random().toString(16).slice(2)),eventId:activeEventId||'EV-01',kind,name:file.name,type:file.type||'',size:file.size,file,uploadedAt:Date.now()};try{await saveKeynoteMaterial(item)}catch(err){return toast('Upload could not be saved: '+err.message,true)}}input.value='';await renderKeynoteManagerResources();if(keynoteTab==='keypoints')renderKeynoteTab('keypoints');toast(files.length+' keynote file'+(files.length===1?'':'s')+' added for this browser.')}
async function renderKeynoteManagerResources(){const host=$('#manager-keynote-resource-list');if(!host)return;try{const items=await listKeynoteMaterials();host.innerHTML=items.length?items.map(item=>'<div class="keynote-manager-item"><span class="keynote-manager-file-icon">'+(item.kind==='video'?'▶':'PPT')+'</span><div><b>'+esc(item.name)+'</b><small>'+(item.kind==='video'?'Keynote video':'Slides & handout')+' · '+formatResourceSize(item.size)+' · '+new Date(item.uploadedAt).toLocaleDateString()+'</small></div><button type="button" data-remove-keynote="'+esc(item.id)+'">Remove</button></div>').join(''):'<div class="empty-state"><b>No keynote materials yet</b>Upload a video or presentation above to share it with participants.</div>'}catch(err){host.innerHTML='<div class="empty-state">'+esc(err.message)+'</div>'}}
async function renderParticipantKeynoteMaterials(){const host=$('#participant-keynote-materials');if(!host)return;keynoteObjectUrls.forEach(url=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url));keynoteObjectUrls=[];try{const items=await listKeynoteMaterials();host.innerHTML='<h3>Session materials</h3><p>Videos and slides shared by your event manager.</p>'+(items.length?items.map(item=>{const url=URL.createObjectURL(item.file);keynoteObjectUrls.push(url);return '<article class="participant-keynote-material"><div class="participant-keynote-material-head"><span class="keynote-manager-file-icon">'+(item.kind==='video'?'▶':'PPT')+'</span><div><b>'+esc(item.name)+'</b><small>'+(item.kind==='video'?'Keynote video':'Slides & handout')+'</small></div></div>'+(item.kind==='video'?'<video controls preload="metadata" src="'+url+'"></video>':'<a class="participant-keynote-download" href="'+url+'" download="'+esc(item.name)+'">↓ &nbsp;Download presentation</a>')+'</article>'}).join(''):'<div class="empty-state">Your event manager has not shared any session materials yet.</div>')}catch(err){host.innerHTML='<div class="empty-state">'+esc(err.message)+'</div>'}}
function renderKeynoteTab(tab=keynoteTab,query=''){keynoteTab=tab;$$('[data-keynote-tab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.keynoteTab===tab));const tools=document.querySelector('#transcript-tools');tools.style.display=tab==='transcript'?'flex':'none';const host=document.querySelector('#keynote-tab-content');if(tab==='transcript'){let rows=keynoteTranscript.filter(x=>(x.speaker+' '+x.text+' '+x.slide).toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()));host.innerHTML=rows.map((x,i)=>`<div class="transcript-row ${i===1?'current-transcript':''}"><time>${x.time}</time><span class="transcript-avatar ${x.initials==='AR'?'orange':''}">${x.initials}</span><div><b>${x.speaker}</b><p>${esc(x.text)}</p></div></div><div class="transcript-slide-marker"><span>□</span>${x.slide}</div>`).join('')||'<div class="empty-state">No transcript matches that search.</div>'}else if(tab==='keypoints'){host.innerHTML='<div class="keynote-keypoints"><article><span>01</span><div><b>Make invisible problems visible</b><p>Local measurements help communities understand the conditions around them.</p><small>From 22:58 · Slides 6–8</small></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><b>Design for the last mile</b><p>Put useful information where people already make decisions, so insight becomes action.</p><small>From 25:12 · Slide 9</small></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><b>Trust belongs in the system</b><p>Build with the people closest to the challenge, and let them shape the data and response.</p><small>From 27:05 · Slide 10</small></div></article></div><section class="keynote-uploaded-insights" id="participant-keynote-materials"></section>';renderParticipantKeynoteMaterials()}else if(tab==='chapters'){host.innerHTML='<div class="keynote-chapters"><button data-slide="6"><time>17:32</time><span><b>Measure what matters locally</b><small>Choosing neighborhood-scale signals</small></span><span>→</span></button><button data-slide="7"><time>20:10</time><span><b>Air quality is a human story</b><small>Connecting readings to daily life</small></span><span>→</span></button><button data-slide="8"><time>23:41</time><span><b>From data to action</b><small>Moving from observation to decisions</small></span><span>→</span></button><button data-slide="9"><time>27:05</time><span><b>Design for the last mile</b><small>Making the next step easy to find</small></span><span>→</span></button><button data-slide="10"><time>30:14</time><span><b>Trust is part of the system</b><small>Community participation and accountability</small></span><span>→</span></button></div>'}else{host.innerHTML='<div class="keynote-resource-list"><button class="keynote-resource" id="download-notes"><span class="file-icon pdf">PDF</span><span><b>Keynote · slide summary</b><small>Sample deck summary · generated for this demo</small></span><span>↓</span></button><button class="keynote-resource" id="download-notes-side"><span class="file-icon txt">TXT</span><span><b>Session notes</b><small>Key ideas and follow-up prompts</small></span><span>↓</span></button><div class="file-disclaimer">No source slide deck was uploaded. Sample materials are generated locally.</div></div>'}}
function selectKeynoteSlide(n){currentSlide=Number(n);let item=keynoteSlides[currentSlide]||keynoteSlides[8];document.querySelector('#slide-number').textContent=`SLIDE ${String(currentSlide).padStart(2,'0')} OF 18`;document.querySelector('#video-title').textContent=item[0];document.querySelector('#slide-caption').textContent=item[1];document.querySelector('#video-chapter').textContent=item[0];document.querySelector('#keynote-time').innerHTML=`${item[2]} <small>/ 45:00</small>`;$$('[data-slide]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',Number(b.dataset.slide)===currentSlide));}
function sendKeynoteQuestion(q){q=q.trim();if(!q)return;const t=q.toLowerCase();let answer;if(t.includes('deadline')||t.includes('submit'))answer='Project submissions close at 1:00 PM IST. Use the Submission portal to save your demo and project details. Source: Event schedule · 1 source.';else if(t.includes('api')||t.includes('technical'))answer='The keynote does not include a live API demo. Example endpoints and sandbox guidance are in Technical details. Source: Event technical guide · 1 source.';else if(t.includes('summar')||t.includes('main point')||t.includes('key idea'))answer='Three ideas: make local conditions visible, design information around the next decision, and build with the communities affected. Source: Keynote transcript · 3 sources.';else if(t.includes('trust')||t.includes('community'))answer='Anika describes trust as part of the system: communities should help shape what gets measured, how it is used, and how results can be corrected. Source: 30:14 · Slide 10.';else if(t.includes('last mile')||t.includes('design'))answer='Design for the last mile means placing useful information next to the real-world decision, so people can act without extra steps. Source: 27:05 · Slide 9.';else answer='This session focuses on turning neighborhood air-quality readings into practical decisions. Try asking about the key ideas, community trust, the last mile, or event logistics.';const log=document.querySelector('#keynote-chat-log');log.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="keynote-user-bubble">${esc(q)}</div><div class="keynote-answer"><p>${esc(answer)}</p><small>${askScope==='keynote'?'From this keynote':'From Hack the Future 2025'} · cited demo content</small></div>`);log.scrollTop=log.scrollHeight;}
function render(){renderEvents();renderOverview();renderOps();renderTeams();renderSchedule();renderKeynoteManagerResources();renderMentors();renderReports();renderComms();renderParticipant();renderParticipantFeatures();renderKeynoteTab(keynoteTab);selectKeynoteSlide(currentSlide);save()}
function audit(type,title,description){state.audits.unshift({type,title,description,time:new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-IN',{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hour12:true,timeZone:'Asia/Kolkata'}).format(new Date()),actor:type==='approval'?'Alex Morgan':'EventBase AI'})}
function trigger(kind){closeModal();let config={mentor:['Mentor cancellation · Priya Nair','high','Mentor availability','Priya Nair has canceled the 11:30 AM product strategy office hours. Teams Orbit and Spark need a replacement before pitch review.','Reassign the session to Arjun Rao, who has product strategy expertise and is available at 11:30 AM.','Teams Orbit and Spark · 6 participants','Reassign mentor session','Move Orbit and Spark’s 11:30 AM session from Priya Nair to Arjun Rao.','Mentor booking'],stream:['Online session outage · livestream room','high','Online session outage','The online room for the 11:00 AM mentor session is not responding. Remote attendees may be unable to join.','Share the approved backup room link with the 18 registered remote attendees. Keep the incident open until the room is confirmed working.','18 online attendees','Share backup room link','Send the approved backup room link to 18 remote attendees. The stream recovery still needs confirmation.','Participant communication'],deadline:['Submission deadline · targeted reminder','medium','Submission readiness','The project deadline is at 1:00 PM. Eight teams have at least one incomplete submission requirement.','Send a targeted reminder to the 8 incomplete teams only. Teams already marked ready are excluded.','8 incomplete teams · 19 participants','Send submission reminder','Remind the 8 teams with incomplete checklists about the 1:00 PM deadline.','Participant communication']}[kind];const id='INC-'+(205+state.incidents.filter(i=>Number(i.id.slice(4))>=205).length);const [title,severity,category,description,plan,target,atitle,adesc,atype]=config;let inc={id,title,category,severity,status:'open',time:'just now',affected:target,owner:'EventBase AI',description,plan,target,kind,approval:'pending'};state.incidents.unshift(inc);let approval={id:'APR-'+(88+state.approvals.length),incident:id,title:atitle,description:adesc,target,type:atype,status:'pending'};state.approvals.unshift(approval);audit('agent','Incident detected',`${title} · ${id}`);audit('agent','Plan prepared',`${plan} Approval required before participant-facing action.`);render();toast('Incident created. Review the agent plan and approval.');go('operations')}
function decide(id,approved){let a=state.approvals.find(x=>x.id===id&&x.status==='pending');if(!a)return toast('This action has already been reviewed.',true);a.status=approved?'approved':'rejected';let i=state.incidents.find(x=>x.id===a.incident);if(approved){if(i.kind==='mentor'){i.status='resolved';i.approval='executed';i.plan='Arjun Rao assigned at 11:30 AM. Booking updated and the participant notification was simulated.';state.messages.unshift({subject:'Mentor session update',audience:'Teams Orbit and Spark',channel:'Email',status:'Simulated',time:'just now'});audit('approval','Approved & executed',`${a.title} · mentor booking updated · participant notification simulated`);audit('agent','Result verified',`Booking reassigned to Arjun Rao · ${i.target} · no external message sent`)}else{state.messages.unshift({subject:a.title,audience:a.target,channel:'Email',status:'Simulated',time:'just now'});i.approval='executed';i.plan=i.kind==='stream'?'Backup room link shared in demo mode. Incident remains open until the session recovery is verified.':'Targeted reminder recorded as a simulated send to incomplete teams only.';audit('approval','Approved & simulated',`${a.title} · ${a.target} · no external delivery`);audit('agent','Execution recorded',`Simulated channel adapter · Incident remains ${i.status} until outcome is verified`)}state.completed++;toast('Approved. Demo action recorded as simulated.')}else{if(i)i.approval='rejected';audit('approval','Rejected by organizer',`${a.title} · no action executed`);toast('Action rejected. No communication was sent.')}render()}
function exportCSV(){const rows=[['Team','Track','Attendance','Submission','Mentor'],...teams];download('eventpilot-team-directory.csv',rows.map(r=>r.join(',')).join('\n'),'text/csv');toast('Team directory downloaded.')};function download(name,text,type){const blob=new Blob([text],{type}),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download=name;a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href)}function exportAudit(){download('eventpilot-audit.json',JSON.stringify(state.audits,null,2),'application/json');toast('Audit log downloaded.')}
function answer(q){let t=q.toLowerCase(),ans;if(t.includes('deadline')||t.includes('submit'))ans='Project submissions close at 1:00 PM IST today. Your checklist is 2 of 4 steps complete. Add your demo link and final submission in the Submission portal. Source: Submission guide · section 2.';else if(t.includes('mentor')||t.includes('coach'))ans='Mentor office hours run from 11:00 AM to 12:30 PM. Your next booking is product coaching with Arjun Rao at 11:00 AM. Open Mentor & technical support if you need help. Source: Event schedule · Saturday.';else if(t.includes('check in')||t.includes('check-in')||t.includes('checkin'))ans='Open Check in in the event menu and choose Check in now. Online participants can check in from the same page. Source: Participant guide · attendance.';else if(t.includes('venue')||t.includes('map')||t.includes('room'))ans='Open Venue map in the event menu to see the main stage, Build Lab, mentor lounge, and The Commons. Online meeting rooms are listed in your schedule. Source: Venue guide.';else if(t.includes('keynote')||t.includes('slides')||t.includes('notes'))ans='The keynote with Dr. Anika Bose is on Keynote & notes. You can review the session notes and download the sample slide summary PDF there. Source: Keynote page.';else if(t.includes('api')||t.includes('technical')||t.includes('sandbox'))ans='The Technical details page has example REST endpoints, a sample response, and sandbox guidance. The URLs and credentials shown there are illustrative and are not live. Source: Technical guide.';else if(t.includes('presentation')||t.includes('demo time')||t.includes('present'))ans='Finalist presentations begin at 2:00 PM IST. Team Orbit should join the online demo room 10 minutes early. Add a reminder from Keynote & notes. Source: Event notifications.';else if(t.includes('result')||t.includes('score')||t.includes('feedback'))ans='Open Results & feedback to see the sample judging rubric and judge comments. Final results are still being prepared. Source: Results page.';else if(t.includes('support')||t.includes('help')||t.includes('stuck'))ans='Open Mentor & technical support to request product guidance or technical help. Include the topic and a little context so the right team can respond.';else if(t.includes('join')||t.includes('online')||t.includes('stream'))ans='Your team is registered online. Use Join session in your schedule for the approved meeting details. If a room is unavailable, check Notifications for an update. Source: Online participation FAQ.';else if(t.includes('lunch')||t.includes('food'))ans='Lunch is available at The Commons from 12:00 PM. Remote participants can check their event notifications for digital meal information. Source: Event handbook · facilities.';else ans='I can help with check-in, the venue map, keynote notes, technical APIs, mentor support, your submission deadline, presentation time, and results. Try asking about one of those. Source: Hack the Future participant handbook.';let log=$('#chat-log');log.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="user-bubble">${esc(q)}</div><div class="assistant-bubble" style="margin-top:8px">${esc(ans)}</div>`);log.scrollTop=log.scrollHeight}
